Output guide/src/assets/leyline-file-demo.gif

Require tmux
Require bash

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1920
Set Height 1000
Set Theme "Catppuccin Frappe"
Set Padding 16
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#1e1e2e"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Framerate 12
Set TypingSpeed 0ms
Set WaitTimeout 15s

Hide
Type "tmux -L leyline-vhs-file-demo attach -t leyline-file-demo"
Enter
Wait+Screen /not present yet/
Show

Sleep 22s
